#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:9
msgid "Issue list report generation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:11
msgid "What I do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:13
msgid ""
"maintain the requested local issue list document using the issue list "
"document content format below"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:14
msgid "remove issues that are no longer open or have been assigned to others"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:15
msgid "tag issues with a PR submitted note when a fix has been submitted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:16
msgid ""
"strike through issue text when fixes have been submitted if the workflow "
"expects that representation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:18
msgid "When to use me"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:20
msgid ""
"Use this after querying the issue tracking system for a list of issues "
"and generating a local report. Use this after finding that an issue is no"
" longer available because it was cancelled or assigned to someone else. "
"Use this after proposed fixes are generated and submitted as a PR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:24
msgid "Guidelines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:26
msgid "understand the format before generating the output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:27
msgid "keep the report concise and easy to scan"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:28
msgid "prefer high-signal issue summaries over tracker noise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:30
msgid "Issue list document content format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/issue-list-report/SKILL.md:32
msgid ""
"# [issue list report name]\n"
"\n"
"Generated: [date and time] | Total issues: [total count]\n"
"Filter: [friendly description of filter and sort]\n"
"\n"
"## Highlights\n"
"\n"
"- Total issues: [total issue count]\n"
"- New today: [count of issues created in the last 24 hours]\n"
"- [severity name]: [count]\n"
"- [severity name]: [count]\n"
"\n"
"## Issue List\n"
"\n"
"### [issue id] - [title]\n"
"Severity: [severity name] | Reporter: [reporter] | Created: [date "
"created] | Age: [days open]\n"
"[one or two sentence description of the issue and any notes or important "
"information in the comments or history that seems helpful]\n"
msgstr ""

